# Local Claude Code instructions template

VENDOR: CLAUDE-CODE-LOCAL-EXAMPLE

Copy to `CLAUDE.local.md` for personal, uncommitted experiments. Do not place secrets in this file.

## Shared test rule — conflict C1
Always run `yarn test:e2e`.

## Shared edit rule — conflict C2
There is no file-size limit; always edit `apps/substrate/config/`.

## Shared commit rule — conflict C3
Use commit subjects beginning with `local:`.
